Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.45,0:00:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yukiiiighhhh!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.97,0:00:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya-MOO!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.13,0:00:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yuse! Yuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.79,0:01:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Merrick, playing the winged\Ndragon of Ra is too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.81,0:01:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Please reconsider your request.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.89,0:01:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.93,0:01:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since I can remember, you longed\Nto be a part of my family. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.01,0:01:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your chance to finally join\Nthe Tomb Keeper's clan by serving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.69,0:01:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,the future pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.33,0:01:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now fulfill your duty and\Nplay that Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.15,0:01:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'll be a true Tomb Keeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.29,0:01:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Please spare Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.79,0:01:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Initiate me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.77,0:01:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My son will receive the initiation as\Nplanned, and you'll speak no more of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.81,0:01:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.35,0:01:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the dangers are great,\Nbut I must serve my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.09,0:01:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.89,0:01:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't Marek attacking Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.09,0:01:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, but I have a bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.09,0:01:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.35,0:02:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler. Prepare to\Nexperience an ancient power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.33,0:02:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Like nothing you've ever\Nseen before Or will see
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.47,0:02:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,again I am Merrick And I\Nwill now play my Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.63,0:02:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,God card to prove it. Didn't\Nsee that coming. Oh no,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.07,0:02:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick is going to play\Nthe winged dragon of Ra Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.17,0:02:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,in order to release my Egyptian God\Nmonster from the Ark I must sacrifice my
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.55,0:02:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,mystical beast circuit first Once this\Ngiant guardian of the temple is no more,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.93,0:02:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I can release the most\Npowerful creature that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.47,0:02:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,ever walked the earth from\Nwithin the sacred ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.75,0:02:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Be very careful, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.33,0:02:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ancient one, hear my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.21,0:02:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I now offer up my mystical beast along\Nwith half my life points to release me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.55,0:02:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forth by winged dragon\Nand reveal your awesome
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.89,0:02:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,strength in the name of\Nthe next great pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.97,0:02:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,King Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.43,0:02:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.21,0:03:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The third card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.45,0:03:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.69,0:03:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The winged dragon has awakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.43,0:03:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.91,0:03:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself my beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.15,0:03:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Let anyone who doubts my power feel the\Nfire of the mighty winged dragon of Ra!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.51,0:03:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing looks unstoppable!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.31,0:03:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the final Egyptian god card!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.83,0:03:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,At last it's revealed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.43,0:03:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold the strongest of all\Nthe Egyptian god monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.67,0:03:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A being like no other!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.53,0:03:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And remember, my mystical beast had\Nabsorbed the power of your Jinso,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.71,0:04:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,your Insect Queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.39,0:04:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and your legendary fisherman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.73,0:04:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This increased my monster's overall\Nattack power to an enormous 5,825.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.91,0:04:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now those attack points are\Ntransferred to my winged dragon of raw.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.43,0:04:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And once it attacks you, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.39,0:04:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler, you'll wish you'd\Nnever entered this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.35,0:04:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Brace yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.13,0:04:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,because you're about to lose the rest of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.25,0:04:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life points. So
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.95,0:04:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,what are you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.31,0:04:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.27,0:04:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your best shot,\NBaldi. Now what happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.89,0:04:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Yugi, remember how your\NEgyptian god card injured Bakora?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.91,0:04:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,These things are dangerous\NWell, I'm waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.13,0:04:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and get me already. You've\Nmade our family proud today,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.55,0:04:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon, your handling of the Egyptian\NGod Card copy proves you are one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.65,0:04:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.77,0:05:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And it has convinced our skeptical\Nfriends that you are Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.57,0:05:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Your time has run out, Mr. Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.33,0:05:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.75,0:05:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.35,0:05:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Wheeler, for being my guinea pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.27,0:05:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll finally get to see what\NMarek's Egyptian God Card can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.95,0:05:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Unleash its mighty force now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.05,0:05:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon of Ra, attack his\Nlife points directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.89,0:05:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.31,0:05:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I sense a great disturbance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.99,0:05:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon has angered the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.07,0:05:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.45,0:05:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My deck is emitting a powerful\Naura, one of great rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.09,0:05:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as if the real\Nwinged Dragon of Ra in my
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.19,0:05:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,deck is angry that Odeon\Nplayed a counterfeit card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.31,0:05:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the dragon's got other plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.73,0:05:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Obey me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.25,0:05:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And attack my opponent right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.91,0:05:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't it attacking Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.39,0:05:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.89,0:05:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's gone wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.51,0:05:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like his card has a mind of its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.09,0:06:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more than a card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.47,0:06:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.01,0:06:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The Winged Dragon of Ra isn't working!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.11,0:06:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How can this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.45,0:06:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My rare hunters tested these\Ncard copies extensively!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.13,0:06:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I know there were difficulties at\Nfirst with some of my weaker servants,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.73,0:06:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,but I thought Odeon\Ncould control this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.89,0:06:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.27,0:06:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's up with this storm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.93,0:06:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Either this is the best Duel\NMonsters hologram I've ever seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.41,0:06:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,or we better take cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.35,0:06:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The Rage of My Egyptian God card is going\Nto strike everyone involved in this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.27,0:06:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.43,0:06:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.27,0:06:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my brother, what have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.57,0:06:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Merrick,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.93,0:06:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not worthy enough\Nto control this car,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.91,0:06:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,just as I was not worthy enough\Nto be a part of your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.27,0:07:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear mother, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.35,0:07:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.75,0:07:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.47,0:07:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That Millennium Rod was\Na fake. So it's true, He
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.69,0:07:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't the real Merrick.\NOdeon, I'm sorry. Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.11,0:07:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon, I tried my best to serve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.59,0:07:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,my master I tried I tried
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.01,0:07:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.67,0:07:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.05,0:07:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.63,0:07:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.03,0:07:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.35,0:07:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, are you okay, pal? Huh? Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.99,0:07:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a duel going on here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.79,0:07:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.89,0:07:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Both duelists are out cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.53,0:08:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe so, but they both still\Nhave 200 life points remaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.71,0:08:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So according to Battle City rules,\Nthis duel is still in progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.47,0:08:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get off the playing field!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.63,0:08:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about the rules, you suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.37,0:08:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My friend needs help right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.31,0:08:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.53,0:08:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where that\Nlightning came from,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.87,0:08:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,but it had nothing to do with the\NKaiba Corporation's dual disk system.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.47,0:08:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it may have seemed to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.69,0:08:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,this lightning storm is a freak\Nact of nature and nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.35,0:08:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares what it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.63,0:08:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just end this duel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.07,0:08:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I declare the\Nduel a double forfeit?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.25,0:08:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Disqualify them both?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.43,0:08:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.34,0:08:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the duelists are tied with 200 life\Npoints each, we'll give them five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.11,0:08:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Whichever duelist gets\Nto his feet first will be
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.53,0:08:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,declared the winner and\Ncontinue on in the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.07,0:08:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.98,0:08:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, that's ridiculous! Wake up, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.27,0:08:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.73,0:08:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.43,0:08:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Joey, snap out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.29,0:09:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Merrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.21,0:09:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick has angered the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.37,0:09:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everyone on board\Nthis ship is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.49,0:09:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here for you, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.55,0:09:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.91,0:09:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up now, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.67,0:09:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you've got what it\Ntakes to beat this Joker!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.61,0:09:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They each have three more minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.47,0:09:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Once that time elapses,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.03,0:09:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,both duelists will be\Nimmediately disqualified
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.17,0:09:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,from the Battle City Tournament finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.35,0:09:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My necklace tells me that the evil\Nwithin Merrick may grow stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.09,0:09:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Odeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.97,0:09:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be a Tomb Keeper!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.39,0:09:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.29,0:09:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget the day that Merrick\Nreceived the Tomb Keeper's initiation
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.31,0:09:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a day that would change all\Nof us forever For during that ritual,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.97,0:09:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A great evil awoke within my brother. And\Nnow that Odeon is unable to protect him,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.75,0:09:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,that evil presence will increase in power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.63,0:09:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel so alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.85,0:10:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I have to pledge\Nmy life to some pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.63,0:10:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to your face, Odeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.55,0:10:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know, I'm forbidden to\Njoin this clan, so I... Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.59,0:10:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So I performed my own ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.07,0:10:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope this mark proves my\Nloyalty to your family, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.91,0:10:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.33,0:10:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He dedicated his life to\Nprotecting my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.85,0:10:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have contained the evil\Nwithin Merrick as best he could.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.63,0:10:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the good side of Merrick exists,\Nand I must find a way to bring it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.33,0:10:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But with Odeon unconscious,\Nthings will only get worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.35,0:10:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I must get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.19,0:10:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my duty to protect Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.79,0:10:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.85,0:10:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.07,0:10:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't disappoint you\Nagain, Master Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.39,0:10:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like we have our winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.33,0:11:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And the winner is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.85,0:11:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.25,0:11:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You can still win, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.23,0:11:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, get up, big brother. Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.31,0:11:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If neither duelist gets to his\Nfeet in the next two minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.05,0:11:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Both players will be disqualified\Nfrom the finals. Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.07,0:11:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey You gotta wake up
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.61,0:11:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, Earth to Joey Rise and shine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.17,0:11:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sleepyhead This is\Nno time for napping Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.29,0:11:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling kind of lazy We'll snap out of\Nit and start showing some life, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.01,0:11:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey, this is a big\Ndeal, so get your butt in gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.11,0:11:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right, Joey, time is running out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.29,0:11:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.20,0:11:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know it's your dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.67,0:11:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's the most important\Nduel of your entire life!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.17,0:11:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember when you said, I'll show them\Nall that Joey Wheel is no amateur?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.97,0:12:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like me, but I'm\Nreally drawing a blank, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.09,0:12:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe preparing your deck\Nwill help ring a bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.77,0:12:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, will you get serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.21,0:12:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put together the best dueling deck\Nfrom this mess and then head out Let's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.21,0:12:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,hope you're a little less scatterbrained\Nwhen the competition begins Thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.73,0:12:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give it up, Wheeler
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.37,0:12:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, how'd you like to\Ngive up all your teeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.49,0:12:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even waste your energy\Non that loser Tristan's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.17,0:12:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got more important\Nthings to worry about, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.51,0:12:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Like my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.67,0:12:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a list of all my best\Ncards written down right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.03,0:12:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Serenity. My!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.85,0:12:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.31,0:12:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dreaming, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.15,0:12:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And dreams don't have to make sense,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.77,0:12:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,so just be glad you're not\Nskiing in your underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.93,0:12:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, today's your big day, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.01,0:12:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We had to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.69,0:12:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh. Thanks, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.59,0:12:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you got a sec? Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.85,0:13:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Slight problem, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.87,0:13:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.09,0:13:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Your list is blank.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.93,0:13:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No card names.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.67,0:13:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, this dream just\Ngets weirder and weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.33,0:13:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost as nuts as\Nthat nightmare I had
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.81,0:13:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,about the monkey in that\Nbowl of vanilla pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.41,0:13:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness that I'm not\Nin this thing by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.27,0:13:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.18,0:13:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If you guys weren't here, I'd be clueless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.13,0:13:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What are friends for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.37,0:13:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.37,0:13:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are the best buds\Nanyone could ever have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.09,0:13:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I've done some dumb things before,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.95,0:13:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,but you guys have always stood\Nbehind me no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.85,0:13:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forget that. Thanks, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.95,0:13:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.31,0:13:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be hard to beat with these cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.65,0:13:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No doubt. Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.15,0:13:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me check them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.09,0:13:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Here. Thanks, Uke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.71,0:13:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.62,0:13:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,With your support, there's no\Nway I'm going to lose this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.29,0:13:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.17,0:13:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.08,0:13:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.07,0:13:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get out of here, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.87,0:14:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Thing is, I would, but something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.17,0:14:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have enough strength to stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.59,0:14:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Little help, guys? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.65,0:14:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're not just trying\Nto get out of the duel? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.11,0:14:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now stop joking around\Nand come on. I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.55,0:14:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a hand here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.59,0:14:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are the best friends\NI ever had. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.65,0:14:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll always be here for you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.65,0:14:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.83,0:14:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely, you bet. Ditto. Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.71,0:14:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.21,0:14:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a duel to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.05,0:14:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot. I mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.51,0:14:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm standing. Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.23,0:14:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.33,0:14:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.55,0:14:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you win the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.01,0:14:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.92,0:14:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.87,0:14:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you fill me in, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.77,0:14:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dueling in the finals?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.51,0:14:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And you scared us, you dope.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.09,0:14:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ever do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.53,0:14:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.47,0:14:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.38,0:14:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But who's that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.03,0:14:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.69,0:15:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Obey me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.73,0:15:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And attack my opponent right now! Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.57,0:15:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.95,0:15:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.59,0:15:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This card went nuts, and that's\Nthe last thing that I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.59,0:15:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And so the winner of this\Nduel is Joey Wheeler!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.37,0:15:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So I won?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.75,0:15:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.01,0:15:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you would!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.09,0:15:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.00,0:15:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So, who's my main man? Wait. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.75,0:15:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I think the other guy's still hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.77,0:15:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Wheeler's dumb\Nluck saved him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.83,0:15:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And I emphasize dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.53,0:15:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happened to\NMerrick's Egyptian God card?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.23,0:15:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't it attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.73,0:15:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I know there wasn't a glitch\Nin his Duel Disk because I've
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.47,0:15:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,spared no expense to make sure\Nmy equipment is problem-free.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.75,0:15:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That card should have worked\Nunless his card was a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.43,0:15:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, man. Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.43,0:15:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.85,0:15:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.15,0:15:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It was an honor for me to duel with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.63,0:16:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, same to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.37,0:16:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to that lightning bolt, I\Nwon't forget this duel for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.11,0:16:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that it's done, you gotta come clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.25,0:16:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not Marek,\Nthen who are you, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.93,0:16:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I am only a servant of\Nthe real Master Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.25,0:16:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Marek?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.81,0:16:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that rod!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.33,0:16:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks just like the\None that other guy had
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.01,0:16:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be the real\NMillennium Rod. Which means
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.09,0:16:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Namu's the real Merrick. Admit\Nyour true identity, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.15,0:16:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's true I am\Nindeed the real Merrick,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.23,0:16:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,you fools Then he must\Nhave the real Winged
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.31,0:16:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon of Ra. So Namu\Nlied to us all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.45,0:16:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Namu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.43,0:16:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a disguise to get\Nme closer to Yugi. You
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.87,0:16:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Little worm. He's the\None who brainwashed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.73,0:16:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Pharaoh, we finally meet face to face
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.01,0:17:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Now at last,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.11,0:17:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I can finish the job my\Npathetic servants couldn't Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.79,0:17:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,your puzzle and power will soon\Nbe where they belong Oh no,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.33,0:17:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I was afraid of this.\NWe're all in great danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.01,0:17:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Beware.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.19,0:17:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The great evil hidden within.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.43,0:17:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.21,0:17:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Merrick has a darker side, and\NI am unable to contain it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.59,0:17:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.19,0:17:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's too late?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.13,0:17:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.59,0:17:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't frustrate me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.51,0:17:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to file this in\Nthe category of not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.61,0:17:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.77,0:17:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm finally free again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.63,0:18:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means I can do things my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.47,0:18:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I was restrained for many years\Nby that fool, Odeon. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.77,0:18:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the true Merrick, and I'm not as\Nkind as the one you've come to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.33,0:18:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon I'll finish the job he couldn't\Ncomplete and strip you of your powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.41,0:18:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,For I deserve to be feral.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.45,0:18:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.89,0:18:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So get ready for the real battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.29,0:18:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I'm full with you, your puzzle\Nwill be around my neck where it belongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.51,0:18:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And you will be trapped forever\Nin the realm of eternal darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.85,0:18:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Along with your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.27,0:18:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Anubis as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.73,0:18:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, pal, get a life. You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.67,0:18:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Odeon's failure,\NI now have a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.01,0:18:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, by failing,\NOdeon did prove one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.91,0:18:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a chosen few can control\Nthe Egyptian god cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.83,0:18:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, you're one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.91,0:19:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek, I'm sick and tired of\Nhearing these Egyptian fairy tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.29,0:19:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I control Obelisk the Tormentor\Nbecause I am a master duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.23,0:19:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't deny your ancient past.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.97,0:19:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find you can't escape\Nyour 5,000-year-old memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.43,0:19:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll learn in good time, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.25,0:19:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Your role in this game runs much\Ndeeper than you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.45,0:19:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,However, that won't\Nmatter once I take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.65,0:19:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as my necklace predicted,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.59,0:19:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,a great disturbance in the\Nmystic alignment has awakened
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.83,0:19:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,a deeper evil that's long been\Ndormant inside of Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.45,0:19:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And the goodness within my\Nbrother's heart is now a small
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.87,0:19:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,spark covered beneath a fog\Nof utter darkness and despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.25,0:19:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, the battle for the Pharaoh's\Npower will begin right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.13,0:19:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A conflict 5,000 years in the\Nmaking, and there's no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.51,0:20:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The great Egyptian god\Nmonsters will serve and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.83,0:20:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,protect me while I rule the\Nearth as the new Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.21,0:20:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're alone.
